  "text_pages": [
    "Exchange at FHNW School of Business - IO Platform\nZum Inhalt springen.\nNavigation\nExchange at FHNW School of Business\nOur degree programmes prepare you to take an active role in the digitalised and interconnected business world. They are offered in English and in German on our three campuses.\nAs an exchange student, you can choose to study in one of our three campuses and pick courses from different degree programmes and campuses. To know more about your most suitable study programme and the course offers, please check our\nStudy Information\n. To read more about our campuses, please refer to the sections below.\nDetailed information on our 3 campuses:\nCampus Basel\nCampus Brugg-Windisch\nCampus Olten\n*The distance between Basel->Brugg-Windisch is approx. 45 minutes; the distance between\nOlten->Basel and Olten->Brugg-Windisch is approx. 30 minutes by\ntrain\nGeneral information about studying at the FHNW School of Business\nGeneral information for incoming students at the FHNW School of Business\nThe Competency Model School of Business FHNW – Video\nFooter\nSuche schliessen\nSuche\nPlease enter your search term\nThis website uses cookies (see\nData Privacy\n). You can adjust the use of cookies in the\nSettings\n.\nBy closing this notice or continuing to browse the site you consent to the use of cookies.\nOK\nCookie-Einstellungen\nFor this website, we distinguish between essential cookies (which are used to ensure error-free use of the site, so that all functionalities are available), as well as statistics and marketing cookies (which allow us to understand and optimise the use of our offerings and promotional opportunities).\nYou can find more information at\nData Privacy\n.\nAllow only essential cookies\nAllow all cookies\nscroll back to the top"
